  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/285e6d569d1a476c6b198a6b8c1eb175571651ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>Portfolio 是一款小型模组与数据包，为游戏新增了绘画目录，所有作品均由艺术家 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyptsh.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Yapetto</a></span> 创作。其中包括《塞纳河畔的早晨》、《正义》与《冥界》等画作。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这是 Portfolio 的 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>模组</strong></span> 版本。如果你想下载数据包版本，<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/portfolio\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></span> 前往数据包页面。</p>\n<h3>Portfolio 的不同系列</h3>\n<p>静物系列 - 1.0 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d2f8f2dbc290f509a929ee382f93b6185894bb1c.png\"></div>\n<p>虚空庄园系列 - 1.1 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a088b34631297e611524006dd859f600fb67e4ce.png\"></div>\n<p>死亡系列 - 1.2 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/eecdb51577c9fcf86767fe82e9b5d5349927b08b.png\"></div>\n<p>蛙类系列 - 1.3 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4af9c8dbb3a374a9018853f2285e7b844314ed6d.png\"></div>\n<p>远方之地系列 - 1.3.5 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/136c997b05135cad0e425556bd6d05bc8db81faa.png\"></div>\n<p>锚系列 - 1.4 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aae2bb2faf08324cbfdc23a6572b5e22aebbdd9f.png\"></div>\n<p>巨人系列 - 1.5 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/800fb441ad894cc87953fcb35678859a72ae93f1.png\"></div>\n<p>元素系列 - 1.5 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/61fa1b2f6ea7171c3a02bd16ff83affc4c3ae5a9.png\"></div>\n<p>云中仙乡系列 - 1.5.5 </p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b03c9b68ed15bf04b645c12a887aaf74d42dc1db.png\"></div>",
